  "description": "The Silkroad Xplore II 275 Select 6.1 is the ultimate, individually configurable expedition touring bike from Tout Terrain, built for epic, long-distance adventures. This capable steel frame touring bike is designed for maximum resilience, high capacity, and low-maintenance performance on world tours.\n\nPinion Gearbox Drivetrain: Equipped with a reliable Pinion C1.12 gearbox and the proven Gates Carbon Drive Belt System. This combination delivers a large 600% gear range and maintenance-free shifting in any environment.\n\nHigh Capacity & Stability: The Silkroad II features a massive 180 kg total capacity (rider/bike/luggage) and runs on smooth-rolling 27.5\" wheels with Vittoria Revolution Tech 27.5\"x2.0\" tires for a balance of efficiency and stability.\n\nIntegrated Luggage System: Comes standard with the integrated Tout Terrain Expedition Rack II featuring EX-Rail compatibility, which expands capacity and simplifies packing. The frame also offers 4 bottle holder mounting positions.\n\nDurable Build: Built with a Silkroad II steel frame (Tout Terrain Thermocrom tube set) and a sturdy Tout Terrain Expedition Fork II (steel fork).\n\nPremium Components: Equipped with powerful Magura MT4 hydraulic disc brakes and integrated lighting powered by a Shutter PL-7 hub dynamo (lighting not explicitly listed but implied by dynamo).\n\nAvailable in sizes M, L, and XL, and finished in a striking British Racing Green Metallic Shiny.\n\nRack: Tout Terrain E-Expedition Rack II with EX Rails II (black, hard anodized)\n\nFrame: Silkroad Xplore II steel frame | Tout Terrain Thermocrom tubing\n\nM L XL\n\nA SEAT TUBE LENGTH (mm) 510 560 610\n\nA1 SEAT TUBE LENGTH (mm) 450 501 552\n\nb TOP TUBE LENGTH (mm) 575 595 615\n\nC CONTROL TUBE LENGTH (mm) 175 205 225\n\nD CHAIN STAY LENGTH (mm) 455 455 455\n\nE WHEELBASE (mm) 1077 1087 1095\n\nF BOTTOM BRACKET LOWERING (mm) 70 70 70\n\nG HEAD TUBE ANGLE (*) 70.5 71 71.5\n\nH SEAT TUBE ANGLE (*) 73 72.5 72\n\nI STACK (mm) 614 644 665\n\nJ REACH (mm) 387 392 399\n\nK OVERHANG HEIGHT (mm) 801 840 873\n\nL FORK INSTALLATION HEIGHT (mm) 407 407 407\n\nM FORK OFFSET (mm) 45 45\n\n45",
